# --- Qutebrowser Profile ---
# Navigation
bind J tabnext
bind K tabprev
bind H back
bind L forward

# Page Control
bind r reload
bind R reloadhard
bind d tabclose
bind u undo

# Hinting (Clicking Links)
bind f hint
bind F hint -b

# URL Opening
bind o fillcmdline open
bind O current_url open
bind t fillcmdline tabopen
bind T current_url tabopen

# Interface
set statusbar enabled
clourscheme custom
